stemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊未来两年将增购200万颗英伟达GPU用于AWS数据中心</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google升级Gemini Live接入Spark智能代理，实现语音操控Gmail与全家桶</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic Claude桌面端上线Cowork内置浏览器，支持独立执行网页操作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布2027财年半年报：净利润达1180亿美元，新一代Vera Rubin平台全面量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式公布2027财年半年报及第二季度业绩，上半年实现营收1778.37亿美元，归母净利润达1180.1亿美元，同比大幅增长161.1%。第二季度单季营收962.21亿美元，同比增长106%，毛利率维持在75%。数据中心业务成为核心驱动力，单季收入达890.23亿美元，同比增长117%。在技术与产品层面，新一代NVIDIA Vera Rubin平台已进入全面量产阶段，首款面向AI智能体的CPU NVIDIA Vera及Groq 3 LPX推理加速器实现投产。此外，英伟达推出NVIDIA Cosmos3及Isaac GR00T人形机器人参考设计，并联合金融机构建立计算融资平台，计划动员超5000亿美元第三方资本支持全球AI基础设施建设。公司预计第三季度营收将达1080亿美元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布极低bit翻译模型，实现1.8B模型压缩至440MB并落地B站</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be4b1431b360d9ee498f60b9a23ac46f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元团队近日推出Hy-MT2-1.8B端侧翻译模型量化方案，成功将原始3.3GB模型压缩至440MB，并已在哔哩哔哩直播弹幕实时翻译场景中落地。该方案包含两档技术：一是面向中高端设备的2-bit拉伸弹性量化（SEQ）方案，体积压缩至574MB；二是面向全系设备的1.25-bit方案，基于Sherry稀疏高效三值量化技术，通过细粒度稀疏机制实现极致压缩。为适配x86生态，英特尔团队针对该模型进行了向量化、权重重排及VNNI指令融合优化，显著提升了在酷睿处理器上的运行速率。在B站实际业务中，该模型运行时内存占用仅500至700MB，单条弹幕翻译耗时500至800毫秒，在保障隐私安全的同时大幅降低了云端调用成本与带宽开销，实现了从实验室Demo到高并发真实业务场景的跨越。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊未来两年将增购200万颗英伟达GPU用于AWS数据中心</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a2056d720736f193e77870812afce2a7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊与英伟达于8月26日宣布深化合作，亚马逊将在未来两年内为AWS数据中心新增部署200万颗英伟达GPU，涵盖Blackwell Ultra、Rubin及Rubin Ultra系列芯片，计划于2027至2028年陆续交付。此次订单较五个月前承诺的100万颗翻倍，旨在满足大模型训练与推理的激增需求。除硬件采购外，双方合作延伸至英伟达网络、Vera CPU、数据软件及机器人平台，亚马逊将引入Omniverse、Cosmos与Isaac技术栈优化仓储自动化。尽管亚马逊持续推进自研Trainium与Graviton芯片以降低依赖，但英伟达凭借此次数百亿美元级订单继续主导其算力基础设施。英伟达二季度财报显示数据中心营收达890亿美元，同比增长117%，并确认Rubin系列已进入量产阶段，显示全球AI算力军备竞赛持续升级</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google升级Gemini Live接入Spark智能代理，实现语音操控Gmail与全家桶</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google近日对Gemini Live进行重大升级，正式接入智能代理系统Spark，将语音交互从单一对话扩展至生产力场景。用户通过语音指令，即可由Spark在后台跨Google Docs、Sheets、Drive及网页执行复杂多步骤任务，如自动整理文档大纲或生成采购清单。此次更新新增“每日简报”功能，支持语音摘要整合Gmail邮件与Google日历信息，并实现免手操作Gmail，包括搜索、概括、加星标、归档及删除邮件。在上下文理解方面，Gemini Live现能结合Gmail、Google Photos、搜索及YouTube等服务历史，提供更个性化的回应。目前，使用Spark相关功能需订阅Google AI Pro及以上版本，而“每日简报”功能则要求至少订阅Google AI Plus。此次升级标志着Gemi</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic Claude桌面端上线Cowork内置浏览器，支持独立执行网页操作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a21541d1e61e63a720f8b69e1f363587.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日在Claude桌面端推出Cowork内置浏览器功能，使Claude能够独立完成浏览网页、读取内容、点击按钮及输入文字等操作。该内置浏览器与用户本地浏览器完全隔离，不读取标签页、书签或密码，用户可按需从Chrome、Edge或Firefox导入特定站点的登录态，但银行、邮箱及单点登录站点默认不导入。该功能本周起向Pro、Max及Team用户推送，Enterprise管理员即日起可全组织启用。内置浏览器适用于搜集资料、整理发票等独立任务，而Claude in Chrome则更适合处理已打开的页面。Anthropic提醒，该功能仍存在提示词注入风险，建议用户优先访问可信站点。用户可在设置中根据需求切换内置浏览器或Claude in Chrome模式。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
